'''Count Yukimura''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]]. A Halloween variant of [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]], he can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Halloween Capsules (Gacha Event)|Halloween Capsules]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] increases Survive chance, damage and speed.

